WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 12.2 · Partnerships & Ecosystem Building
Partnership strategy and value proposition

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Say why you partner, what you will not compromise, and what each side gains.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Write a few partnership principles you will keep.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Show what you bring and what they bring.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Name the boundaries before the first conversation.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Pan del Barrio (Social enterprise · company, Peru)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Pan del Barrio to employers: certified bakers and 12 months’ follow-up; in return, formal jobs and skills feedback. No unpaid trial periods.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your principles and one partner value proposition.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
